<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Sayori Bot</title>
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
  <meta name="description" content="Sayori is a Discord bot with fun trivia, guessing, and leaderboard commands.">

  <!-- Bootstrap + AOS -->
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
    crossorigin="anonymous">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/aos@2.3.4/dist/aos.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/sayori.css">


</head>

<body>


  <!-- Hero aka The main place where you will edit the info -->
  <header class="text-center py-5" data-aos="fade-down">
    <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">Sayori Bot</h1>
    <p class="lead">Fun Trivia • Guess Games • Leaderboards</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container my-3">
    Sayori is your ultimate game-night companion. An energetic and interactive bot build to spark fun and friendly
    competition in any Discord Server. From lightning-fast trivia showdowns to clever Guessging games, Sayori offers a
    variety of challenges that keep your Community engaged amd coming back for more. Whether you're hosting a cozy group
    of friends or managing a bustling server, this bot delivers entertainment for everyone, with seamless commands,
    real-time leaderboards and fresh content added regularity.
  </div>

  <div class="container d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-md-center">
    <div class="my-3 bold flex-grow-1">
      Add Sayori today and turn your server into a hub of excitement, laughter, and epic battles of wits.
    </div>

    <div class="discord-btn2">
      <a href="https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=1403392346053411029">Add me</a>
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- Commands list is given below -->
  <div class="container my-5">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-4" data-aos="fade-up">Tea Games</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-command="/countrytea" title="Click to copy command">
        <h5>!countrytea start &lt;pts&gt;</h5>
        <p> Put your knowledge of countries to the test! Answer questions about nations from around the world and race
          against other players to reach the target score first. </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100" data-command="/mathtea" title="click to copy command">
        <h5>!mathtea start &lt;pts&gt; &lt;difficulty&gt;</h5>
        <p> Challenge your calculation skills in a fast-paced math battle. Choose a difficulty, solve problems before
          your opponents, and be the first to reach the target score. </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-command="/animetea" title="click to copy command">
        <h5>!animetea start &lt;pts&gt; &lt;category&gt;</h5>
        <p> Think you know your favorite anime? Answer anime questions, and compete against other players to claim
          victory. </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300" data-command="/jumbletea" title="click to copy command">
        <h5>!jumbletea start &lt;pts&gt;</h5>
        <p> Scrambled words appear one after another in this rapid-fire word game. Unscramble them before everyone else
          and race to reach the target score first. </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300" data-command="/gktea" title="click to copy command">
        <h5>!gktea start &lt;pts&gt;</h5>
        <p> From science and history to entertainment and everyday facts, test your general knowledge against other
          players and race to the winning score. </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300" data-command="/geotea" title="click to copy command">
        <h5>!geotea start &lt;pts&gt;</h5>
        <p> Explore the world through geography trivia! Answer questions about places, landmarks, capitals, and more
          while competing to reach the target score first. </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-12 command-box endgame-com copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400" data-command="/endgame" title="Click to copy Endgame command">
        <h5>!endgame</h5>
        <p>Used to end the tea games (applicable for all games mentions above)</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-center my-5" data-aos="fade-up">Social Deduction Games</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-command="/mafia" title="Click to copy Command">
        <h5>/mafia</h5>
        <p>The classic OG mafia game (Can be started using both !mafia or !ma) with multiple extra roles available!</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100" data-command="/gta" title="Click to copy command">
        <h5>/gta</h5>
        <p>Describe your secret word, uncover the impostors, and vote out suspicious agents in this social deduction game.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-command="/finalnight" title="Click to copy Command">
        <h5>!finalnight / !fn - Alpha!</h5>
        <p>Similiar to Mafia but here each person is assigned 3 rooms and the Assasins can only kill the civilians they share room with</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-center mb-4" data-aos="fade-up">Trivia Games</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h5>!countrytrivia &lt;heart&gt;</h5>
        <p> Put your knowledge of countries to the test! Answer questions about nations from around the world and race
          against other players to reach the target score first. </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <h5>!math trivia &lt;difficulty&gt; &lt;hearts&gt;</h5>
        <p> Challenge your calculation skills in a fast-paced math battle. Choose a difficulty, solve problems before
          your opponents, and be the first to reach the target score. </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
        <h5>!anime trivia &lt;category&gt; &lt;hearts&gt;</h5>
        <p> Think you know your favorite anime? Answer anime questions, and compete against other players to claim
          victory. </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
        <h5>!gk trivia start &lt;heart(s)&gt;</h5>
        <p> From science and history to entertainment and everyday facts, test your general knowledge against other
          players and race to the winning score. </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-center my-5" data-aos="fade-up">Guess Games</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-command="/guess" title="Click to copy /guess">
        <h5>!guess</h5>
        <p>Starts a normal guess the number round of range (1–100000)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100" data-command="/guesstime" title="Click to copy /guesstime">
        <h5>!guesstime &lt;seconds&gt;</h5>
        <p>Starts a Timed mode guess the number with range (1-1000)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-command="/guessword" title="click to copy /guessword">
        <h5>/guessword / !guessword / !gw</h5>
        <p>Start a Guess the Word where the bot choses a hint giver (who gets a Secret Word by the bot) and the others
          have to guess the secret word</p>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300" data-command="!guesshelp" title="click to copy">
        <h5>!guesshelp</h5>
        <p>Help for Guess Games.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-12 command-box endgame-com copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400" data-command="/endgame" title="click to copy /endgame">
        <h5>!endgame</h5>
        <p>Ends all Guess Games except !gw.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-center my-5 " data-aos="fade-up">Admin Commands</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-command="!enable">
        <h5>!enable</h5>
        <p>Enable all the commands for that channel.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100" data-command="!disable">
        <h5>!disable</h5>
        <p>Disable all the commands for that channel.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-command="!premium">
        <h5>!premium</h5>
        <p>Check the premium details.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-command="!buy">
        <h5>!buy</h5>
        <p>Buy premium for your server.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-center my-5" data-aos="fade-up">Misc Commands</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-4 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-command="/leaderboard">
        <h5>!leaderboard / !lb</h5>
        <p>Shows server leaderboard.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 command-box" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <h5>!stats</h5>
        <p>Shows server and global stats.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 command-box copy-command" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-command="/help" title="click to copy the help command">
        <h5>!help / /help</h5>
        <p>Displays the help menu.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- Discord Widget -->
  <div class="container my-5" id="discord-widget" data-aos="fade-up">
    <div class="discord-card text-center p-4">
      <h3 id="server-name" class="discord-heading mb-2">Loading...</h3>
      <hr class="discord-divider">
      <p id="member-count" class="fs-5">Fetching online members...</p>
      <a id="discord-link" href="#" target="_blank" class="discord-btn mt-3">
        🚀 Join Our Discord
      </a>
      <!-- <a id="link" href="https://discord.gg/CAzPpWJfmS" class="hidden">
        🚀 Join Our Discord
      </a> -->
      <div class="particle-bg"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    async function loadDiscordWidget() {
      try {
        const res = await fetch("https://discord.com/api/guilds/989942565908389908/widget.json");
        const data = await res.json();

        document.getElementById("server-name").textContent = data.name;

        animateCount("member-count", data.presence_count);
        document.getElementById("discord-link").href = data.instant_invite;
      } catch (err) {
        document.getElementById("server-name").textContent = "Server unavailable";
        document.getElementById("member-count").textContent = "Try again later.";
      }
    }

    function animateCount(id, target) {
      let el = document.getElementById(id);
      let current = 0;
      let increment = Math.ceil(target / 60);
      let interval = setInterval(() => {
        current += increment;
        if (current >= target) {
          current = target;
          clearInterval(interval);
        }
        el.textContent = `${current} online members ✨`;
      }, 16);
    }

    // Initial load
    loadDiscordWidget();

    // Auto-refresh every 30s
    setInterval(loadDiscordWidget, 30000);
  </script>


  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel+Decorative:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">



  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="text-center p-3 mt-5">
    &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Sayori Bot - A Shadowveil Studioz Project.
  </footer>

  <!-- Scripts -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/aos@2.3.4/dist/aos.js"></script>
  <script>AOS.init();</script>

  <script>
    document.querySelectorAll(".copy-command").forEach((box) => {
      box.addEventListener("click", async () => {
        const command = box.dataset.command;

        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(command);

        const originalTitle = box.getAttribute("title");

        box.setAttribute("title", "Copied!");

        setTimeout(() => {
          box.setAttribute("title", originalTitle);
        }, 1500);
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>

</html>